&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m playing with my new personal logo and I would like to use my initials of PH and transform them into the cube which I&amp;rsquo;m almost there I think (Cube like a basic 3d object - I want to focus on 3d design :) ). But there is still something what I don&amp;rsquo;t see what&amp;rsquo;s wrong. I would like to have same width on the top and bottom and between P and H. Technically the P is same like H but optically the H looks wider. Also I tried some grid&amp;hellip;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Font ID needed of the brand 'chocomel'</title><link>https://jolg42.github.io/typophile/102473/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 Apr 2013 06:43:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://jolg42.github.io/typophile/102473/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Hello, I&amp;rsquo;m searching for the font of the Dutch brand &amp;lsquo;Chocomel&amp;rsquo;&lt;br&gt;
